00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.880
are most important for your website.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.280
Common metrics include page load time,

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:49.760
time to first byte,

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:52.600
render start time, and interactive time.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.320
Line these metrics with your purpose

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.960
to identify the most critical areas for improvement.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.060
Set measurable targets.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:03.680
Establish specific, measurable, achievable,

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:07.800
relevant, and time-bound goals, or smart goals.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:10.600
For example, set a goal to reduce page load time

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.520
by 30% within three months,

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:18.520
or achieve a TTFB of under 20 milliseconds.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.120
