00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.080
Consider factors like device usage, mobile versus desktop,

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.720
geographic location, and connection speeds

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.340
to tailor your goals accordingly.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:46.560
Break it down.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:48.180
