00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:01.000
or implementing a content delivery network.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.040
Breaking down goals into manageable steps

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.420
makes them more achievable

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:07.600
and allows for incremental improvements.

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.880
Monitor and iterate.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.420
Regularly monitor your website's performance

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:16.120
using performance monitoring tools or website analytics.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.760
Track progress toward your goals

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:21.080
and identify areas that need further optimization.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.160
Continuously iterate your strategies

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:27.600
to adapt to changing technologies and user expectations.

